Spoilers (I suppose)


If you come across a chest/large box, first try the easy way:

Stand on top of it and say #loot (or however your system does extended commands)
if it says its locked then you have to do it the hard way.

Possibilities:

- A key
- A Credit card
- A lock pick
- A Osaku

All of these can be (a)pplied when standing over the chest, when it asks the
direction say "."

If you don't have any of these, then you can try to force the lock with a sharp
weapon. WARNING: This can destroy the weapon. To do this wield the weapon
you want to use, and say #force, it may take several goes before the lock gives.

Failing this you can attack the chest itself with a blunt weapon, or simply
stand to one side and kick (^D on my system) the chest. Both of these methods
have the disadvantag that you may break some of the contents of the chest if
they are made of glass.

There are also other possible methods, all of which tend to be a bit over the
top. Eg., spell of knock, wand of opening, any others?

